  "img": "icons/svg/explosion.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>You have traveled or been flung through the realms of time and space. Without The Multiverse itself, you would not be who you are now.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers</div><p>Assign all the dice you rolled at the end of the background step to any of the following powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.QD7BBCX8C7mnA1FJ]{Awareness}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.7tvi62LlYMr2d8ho]{Cosmic}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.US0ZfFzUJ9CEcS6M]{Intuition}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.kTRnwcMJLHbZopWQ]{Speed}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fbddUiHTU2MMOSU6]{Teleportation}</p><p>• Select from Psychic powers category</p><p>• Select from Self Control powers category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of these Yellow abilities, each using a different power:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.Hg5vKHyzSKO3s5WD]{Power From Beyond}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.2NkOAQ0wyZAI3lb2]{Respond In Kind}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.KA0cpHBToJFwX0qN]{Dread Pallor}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.cFs7VE7rmymtI1fl]{Reality Scorned}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Additional Info</div><p>Gain one extra power from any category at d6.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Archetype</div><p>Roll d10, d8, d6 for archetype selection.</p></section>"
  },
